  "description": "Review of the Top 5 Stocks",
  "body_html": "<p>Good morning everyone, just a very quick note. I had a video recorded…and then I discovered that my microphone was not plugged in all the way. So the audio was hot garbage. I will have to re-record this video. I also have family flying back today, so it will be later…probably tonight or tomorrow. </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>Regardless, didn’t want to leave you in the dark or “not notified.” I reviewed OKLO, Palantir, Applied Digital Corp., Joby Aviation and Lemonade. I have a stop limit buy order set for one of these at market open. You can also view on <a href=\"https://www.stocktokdashboard.com/\">Stocktokdashboard.com</a> or in the “Quick Notes” in the chat. A few quick details below 👇</p>",
